  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resettlement Support Programme for the Central American Minors Parole Program (CAMP) from El Salvador, Honduras and Guatemala in 2019-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USA for IOM, with donations from the Shapiro Foundation, are funding IOM to cover transportation and related costs for Central American Minors (CAM) Parolees. IOM is facilitating the travel arrangement and providing movement management to the final destination for this caseload in coordination with all partners.</narrative>
  </description>
